          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Witness 2",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>Correct</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ibr\u0101h\u012bm b. \u02bfAl\u012b b. Ibr\u0101h\u012bm testified about everything in this testimony&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and he wrote in it and explained and wrote on the same date.&nbsp;</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
